; Synthetic survey whose shots reach into surveys B and C, which no file
; opens with #PREFIX. B:X1 is the first station in B and is named once;
; C:Y1 is the first station in C and is named twice.
#PREFIX A
#UNITS D=Meters A=Degrees V=Degrees DECL=0
A1	A2	10.0	0	0
A2	B:X1	10.0	90	0
A2	C:Y1	10.0	180	0
C:Y1	C:Y2	10.0	180	0
